{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_drmundo_addon": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>想去哪就去哪<>：挡下首个硬控（扣当前生命7%），免控<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>并丢下药罐，捡起回复<#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<>。<#ff9028ff>大力行医<>：每<#ffb900ff>7秒<>一次普攻按已损生命最多翻倍地额外造成<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>伤害，打死的单位被打飞，撞伤身后的敌人。",
        "skill": "【附加包】扔出骨锯，命中第一个单位造成<#a974ffff>140<><#a974ffff>魔法伤害<>，<#ef5350ff>减速40%<><#ffb900ff>2秒<>并回复<#7dd87dff>20<>生命；命中英雄改为造成其当前生命20%的魔法伤害、多回复<#7dd87dff>40<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】电击身边的敌人<#ffb900ff>4秒<>（每<#ffb900ff>0.33秒<><#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<>），受到伤害的75%存为灰色生命；结束时电击造成<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>，命中英雄回复全部灰色生命，只命中小兵回复一半。",
        "ult": "【附加包】生命危急时注射：回复已损生命25%与<#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<>生命，<#ffb900ff>10秒<>内最大生命+200、每秒回复<#7dd87dff>40<>生命、移速+25%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_drmundo_addon": {
        "attack": "【附加包】<#ff9028ff>想去哪就去哪<>：擋下首個硬控（扣目前生命7%），免控<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>並丟下藥罐，撿起回復<#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<>。<#ff9028ff>鈍擊創傷<>：每<#ffb900ff>7秒<>一次普攻依已損生命最多翻倍地額外造成<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>傷害，打死的單位被打飛，撞傷身後的敵人。",
        "skill": "【附加包】扔出骨鋸，命中第一個單位造成<#a974ffff>140<><#a974ffff>魔法傷害<>，<#ef5350ff>緩速40%<><#ffb900ff>2秒<>並回復<#7dd87dff>20<>生命；命中英雄改為造成其目前生命20%的魔法傷害、多回復<#7dd87dff>40<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】電擊身邊的敵人<#ffb900ff>4秒<>（每<#ffb900ff>0.33秒<><#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<>），受到傷害的75%存為灰色生命；結束時電擊造成<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>，命中英雄回復全部灰色生命，只命中小兵回復一半。",
        "ult": "【附加包】生命危急時注射：回復已損生命25%與<#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<>生命，<#ffb900ff>10秒<>內最大生命+200、每秒回復<#7dd87dff>40<>生命、跑速+25%。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_drmundo_addon": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Goes Where He Pleases<>: the first hard crowd control is shaken off (7% of current health) and he is immune for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<> and drops a chem-tank; picking it up heals <#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<>. <#ff9028ff>Blunt Force Trauma<>: every <#ffb900ff>7s<> an attack deals, up to doubled by missing health, <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> more; a unit it kills is flung, hurting enemies behind it.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Throws his bone saw at the first unit hit: <#a974ffff>140 magic damage<>, a <#ef5350ff>40% slow<> for <#ffb900ff>2s<> and <#7dd87dff>20<> health back. A champion takes 20% of its current health as magic damage instead and heals him <#7dd87dff>40<> more.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Zaps nearby enemies for <#ffb900ff>4s<> (<#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<> every <#ffb900ff>0.33s<>), storing 75% of the damage taken as grey health. The final zap deals <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>: hitting a champion heals all the grey health, only minions half.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] Doses himself when his health runs low: heals 25% of his missing health and <#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<> at once and for <#ffb900ff>10s<> gains 200 max health, <#7dd87dff>40<> health a second and 25% move speed."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_drmundo_addon": {
        "attack": "[애드온] <#ff9028ff>가고 싶은 데로 간다<>: 첫 강력한 군중 제어를 떨쳐내고 (현재 체력 7%) <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> 면역, 화학 통을 떨어뜨려 주우면 <#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<> 회복. <#ff9028ff>둔기에 의한 외상<>: <#ffb900ff>7초<>마다 잃은 체력에 따라 최대 2배로 기본 공격이 <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> 추가 피해, 처치한 유닛을 날려 뒤의 적에게 피해.",
        "skill": "[애드온] 뼈톱을 던져 첫 대상에게 <#a974ffff>140 마법 피해<>, <#ffb900ff>2초<> <#ef5350ff>40% 둔화<>, <#7dd87dff>20<> 회복. 챔피언이면 현재 체력 20% 마법 피해와 <#7dd87dff>40<> 추가 회복.",
        "skill2": "[애드온] <#ffb900ff>4초<> 동안 주변 적을 감전 (<#ffb900ff>0.33초<>마다 <#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<>), 받은 피해의 75%를 회색 체력으로 저장. 마지막 감전 <#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>: 챔피언 적중 시 회색 체력 전부, 미니언만 적중 시 절반 회복.",
        "ult": "[애드온] 체력이 위험하면 투약: 잃은 체력 25%와 <#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<> 회복, <#ffb900ff>10초<> 동안 최대 체력 +200, 초당 <#7dd87dff>40<> 회복, 이동 속도 +25%."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_drmundo_addon": {
        "attack": "【アドオン】<#ff9028ff>気ままな往診<>：最初の強い行動妨害を振り払い（現在体力7%）<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>無効、薬缶を落とし拾うと<#7dd87dff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>60%<>回復。<#ff9028ff>野蛮な痛み<>：<#ffb900ff>7秒<>毎に失った体力で最大2倍に通常攻撃が<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>追加ダメージ、倒した敵を吹き飛ばし後ろの敵に当てる。",
        "skill": "【アドオン】骨ノコギリを投げ最初の敵に<#a974ffff>140魔法ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>40%スロウ<>（<#ffb900ff>2秒<>）、<#7dd87dff>20<>回復。チャンピオンなら現在体力20%の魔法ダメージと<#7dd87dff>40<>追加回復。",
        "skill2": "【アドオン】<#ffb900ff>4秒<>周囲を感電（<#ffb900ff>0.33秒<>毎に<#a974ffff>18<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>6%<>）、被ダメージの75%をグレー体力に。最後の電撃<#a974ffff>90<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>：チャンピオンに当たれば全回復、ミニオンのみなら半分。",
        "ult": "【アドオン】体力が危ないと投与：失った体力25%と<#7dd87dff>200<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#7dd87dff>100%<>回復、<#ffb900ff>10秒<>最大体力+200、毎秒<#7dd87dff>40<>回復、移動速度+25%。"
      }
    }
  }
}
